      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-04-18_WidnesExaminer_art0191" n="art0191">
        <head>RUNCORN RATES INCREASED'</head>
        <p>RUNCORN RATES INCREASED'</p>
        <p>The Runcorn Urban Council on TII elected Councillor Samuel Taylor the Council.</p>
