      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-04-18_WidnesExaminer_art0192" n="art0192">
        <head>BACKACHE NOT A DISEA</head>
        <p>BACKACHE NOT A DISEA</p>
        <p>But a Symptom, a Da Signal . Which Every Wools</p>
        <p>Should Heed.</p>
